Subject: [PATCH 77/79] dt-bindings: media: qcom,sm8550-iris: Add SM8450

SM8450 (and SM8475) have an IRIS2 video codec with the same resources
as SM8550: two GDSCs plus MXC and MMCX, three clocks and the bus reset.

Local Diting bring-up change, not submitted upstream.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/qcom,sm8550-iris.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/qcom,sm8550-iris.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/qcom,sm8550-iris.yaml
index 0400ca1bf..5f3ca956c 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/qcom,sm8550-iris.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/qcom,sm8550-iris.yaml
@@ -24,6 +24,7 @@ properties:
           - const: qcom,sm8550-iris
       - enum:
           - qcom,qcs8300-iris
+          - qcom,sm8450-iris
           - qcom,sm8550-iris
           - qcom,sm8650-iris
           - qcom,x1p42100-iris
